{"id":"658225","name":"白菜炒粉条","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658225/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"粉条","amount":"适量"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"60g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱段","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"白菜清洗后手撕成块。","img":"images/658225/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"泡好的粉条，瘦肉切片，用酱油、蚝油、淀粉腌入味，再准备适量的蒜末和葱段。","img":"images/658225/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"粉条加入1勺酱油和少量老抽。","img":"images/658225/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"拌匀上色。","img":"images/658225/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"起锅烧油，炒香蒜末。","img":"images/658225/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入肉片翻炒。","img":"images/658225/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"炒至变色。","img":"images/658225/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入白菜翻炒片刻。","img":"images/658225/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"再倒入粉条。","img":"images/658225/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入适量的盐翻炒入味。","img":"images/658225/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入适量的清水盖盖焖上两分钟。","img":"images/658225/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"时间到，倒入葱段。","img":"images/658225/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入适量的蚝油和胡椒粉，翻拌入味即可。","img":"images/658225/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658225/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}